We come out of the club.
There is the tea vendor brother's small shop outside.
Amit asks him for tea.
He says, "Brother, give four cutting chais."
We all drink hot tea and talk.
Now Amit, Neha, and Sanjay are my good friends.
Today, for the first time, they talk to me using 'tum'.
Neha asks me, "Maya, when did you come to Mumbai?"
I answer, "I came here in January."
Sanjay asks, "Did you leave Mexico for a job?"
I say, "Yes, I started work at a software company here."
Amit asks, "Did you come to India all alone?"
I hold the tea cup and say, "Yes, I came alone."
Neha says, "Oh wow, you made a very big decision!"
They all listen to my words carefully.
Sanjay says, "Tell us about your first day in Mumbai."
I remember that day in January very well.
I start telling them my story.
